README — 15 December 2025 (Second Email)

This folder contains the second email sent on 15 December 2025 notifying
the Ministry of Justice and HMCTS Legal that the Judicial Review evidence
underpinning AC-2025-LON-004293 has been placed in the public domain and
notified to the press.

The email enclosed the press release and the unanswered Pre-Action
Protocol Letter dated 19 November 2025 and provided a direct link to the
public GitHub repository containing the evidential record and
transmission history.

This correspondence was informational in nature and intended to ensure
full transparency and remove any possible claim of lack of notice.
